# Boiling Rock Rioter: "Tap an untapped Ally you control: Exile target card from a graveyard" and "you may cast an Ally spell from among cards you own
# exiled with this creature". Turn 3 Bot1's Lightning Bolt kills its own Earth Kingdom Protectors and the Rioter, the only Ally Bot1 controls (Bot2's
# untapped Protectors may not pay), taps itself (summoning sickness does not matter, and it is not its {T}) to exile it. Tapped, with only a non-Ally
# Ornithopter beside it, the Rioter cannot pay for a second activation. Turn 5 it attacks, the exiled Protectors is offered, affordable with Mox Pearl,
# and Bot1 declines: it stays in exile, unplayed.

